    "created_at": "2026-09-17T15:55:54Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-09-17T15:55:54Z",
    "body": "> A couple administrative requests:\n> \n> * Can we make a tag for meeting agendas, so that they can be easily filtered out from all the actual bugs in this repo?\n> * Maybe it would be nice to post the URL to the minutes back to the issue?\n\nI think the main reason that's tough is that these meetings span three separate repos. I suppose we could make a common label name across the three (e.g. `Agenda+Taskforce`) and pull them.\n\nThe minutes suggestion is a good one. I'll try to remember to do that in the future! Help me remember. 😄 \n\nMinutes from today: https://www.w3.org/2026/09/17-css-minutes.html",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
